{"id": "61565", "title": "暖暖入我怀（甜宠）", "author": "韩小歌", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 18, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/61/61565.htm", "intro": "其实完整版应该是（搞笑吐槽无脑小白高干甜宠外加娱乐圈神马神马的）强力日更中！走过路过不要错过！！*( ˉ▽ˉ)/* \r\n\r\n【无节操文案】\r\n\r\n暖暖：不要啦！上次好痛的！≧﹏≦\r\nBoss：乖，要不然时间久了会长好的，你也不想到时再痛一次吧？\r\n暖暖：⊙▂⊙怎么可能？！你骗我！\r\nBoss：我什么时候骗过你？信不信随便你吧。\r\n暖暖：等……等等！≧︿≦\r\n\r\n【演职员表】＼( ^▽^ )／ \r\n\r\n【男主】万能属性腹黑Boss\r\n【女主】二逼属性奇葩吃货\r\n\r\n【联合主演】\r\n大胸脑残奔放萝莉 时尚魔头爆裂女王受\r\n白痴种马大明星 傲娇冷艳天才少女\r\n忠犬痴情帅大叔 贞子系阴森女\r\n\r\n内容标签： 都市情缘 高干 情有独钟", "base": "files/article/html/61/61565", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "9083441.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "9083442.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "9083443.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "9083445.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "9083447.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "9083450.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "9083451.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "9083453.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "9083455.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "9083457.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "9083459.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-60", "file": "9083462.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-65", "file": "9083464.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-70", "file": "9083466.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-75", "file": "9083468.html", "available": false}, {"title": "76-80", "file": "9083473.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-85", "file": "9083474.html", "available": false}, {"title": "86-87完结", "file": "9083475.html", "available": false}]}